cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and the software entry below."
title: >-
  UniformFusion: Class-Conditioned Multi-Scale Regional Learning for Dual-View
  X-Ray Multi-Label Recognition
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: 代
    given-names: 程宇
    email: cangyiyiyiyi@gmail.com
# TODO: 论文正式发表后补充其余作者、期刊/会议与 DOI，并在此处或下方加入
#       preferred-citation 指向正式论文条目。
repository-code: "https://github.com/cangyiyiyiyi-creator/UniformFusion"
url: "https://github.com/cangyiyiyiyi-creator/UniformFusion"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation and reproduction code for dual-view (OL / SD) X-ray
  multi-label recognition. The main method (Uniform Fusion) combines a
  ResNet-50 dual-branch backbone with C4/C5 multi-scale class-query Top-K
  regional evidence, counterfactual experts and uniform logit aggregation.
  The repository provides the locked sources, data split manifests,
  per-experiment runners and a one-command reproduction entry point
  (bash main.sh) enforcing the paper protocol: train on train, select the
  checkpoint on validation, and evaluate the test set exactly once.
license: MIT
version: v1.0-paper
date-released: "2026-09-19"
keywords:
  - x-ray
  - multi-label recognition
  - dual-view
  - class-conditioned
  - multi-scale regional learning
  - convnextv2
  - resnet50
  - pytorch
  - reproducibility
